{"publicId":"686a7ccc-2a0d-4c69-ab21-e463363bd679","title":"Base Layer2主网Denim升级：块时间缩短至200毫秒，引发交易延迟与智能合约问题","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T19:00:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-05T19:00:00.000Z","digest":"Base Layer2主网通过Denim升级将块时间从2秒缩短至200毫秒，日处理能力提升至432,000笔（原43,200笔），并取消Flashblocks预确认层架构，改为直接通过主网块实现快速确认【旧】【新】。升级后出现交易包含率下降问题，14分钟内部分节点需升级至v1.5.3修复状态根漏洞，同时因区块计数缩短10倍，影响依赖区块数的智能合约（如质押解锁）【新】。官方称优化了B20合规流程以支持更快交易，但未披露具体调整方案【旧】【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-06T06:22:57.442Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Base主网升级Denim，将区块时间缩短至200毫秒并替换Flashblocks","latestReport":{"id":"y5pyr6p4i8ebmjdfcbd7u39xt"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fgaI3TI9tsX4","title":"Base deploys Denim upgrade on mainnet","firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T19:00:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"y5pyr6p4i8ebmjdfcbd7u39xt","title":"Base主网升级Denim，将区块时间缩短至200毫秒并替换Flashblocks","summary":"Base主网升级Denim，将区块时间缩短至200毫秒并替换Flashblocks，频率提升至五块每秒。","source":{"name":"The Block","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T19:00:00.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"y5pyr6p4i8ebmjdfcbd7u39xt","title":"Base主网升级Denim，将区块时间缩短至200毫秒并替换Flashblocks","summary":"Base主网升级Denim，将区块时间缩短至200毫秒并替换Flashblocks，频率提升至五块每秒。","source":{"name":"The Block","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T19:00:00.000Z","selected":true}],"timeline":[{"id":"y5pyr6p4i8ebmjdfcbd7u39xt","title":"Base主网升级Denim，将区块时间缩短至200毫秒并替换Flashblocks","summary":"Base主网升级Denim，将区块时间缩短至200毫秒并替换Flashblocks，频率提升至五块每秒。","source":{"name":"The Block","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T19:00:00.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-06T16:00:00.000Z","heat":18,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","heat":17.5,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-06T18:00:00.000Z","heat":17,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000Z","heat":16.5,"participants":3